<title>UK: London silver fixes easier at 467.20 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier at 467.20 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixes lower at 467.20 cents, versus 471.75 previously. Watching gold for direction.</p>
<p>GOLD - Barely changed at $342.70/$343.00.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Stronger at $395.75/$396.75, up $1.25.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $3.00 at $180.75/$181.75.</p>
